## 📝 Query Patterns

### ✅ CORRECT Patterns

```javascript
// 1. Get all jadwal khusus for admin
const [jadwalKhusus] = await db.execute(
  `SELECT jk.*, k.nama_kelas, g.nama as nama_guru
   FROM jadwal_khusus jk
   LEFT JOIN kelas k ON jk.kelas_id = k.id_kelas
   LEFT JOIN guru g ON jk.guru_id = g.id_guru
   WHERE jk.status = 'aktif'
   ORDER BY FIELD(jk.hari, 'Senin', 'Selasa', 'Rabu', 'Kamis', 'Jumat', 'Sabtu'), 
            jk.jam_mulai`
);

// 2. Get jadwal khusus for specific class (includes global schedules)
const [jadwalKhusus] = await db.execute(
  `SELECT jk.*, g.nama as nama_guru
   FROM jadwal_khusus jk
   LEFT JOIN guru g ON jk.guru_id = g.id_guru
   WHERE jk.status = 'aktif' 
     AND (jk.kelas_id = ? OR jk.kelas_id IS NULL)
   ORDER BY jk.jam_mulai`,
  [kelasId]
);

// 3. Check time conflict for same class
const [conflicts] = await db.execute(
  `SELECT id, nama_kegiatan 
   FROM jadwal_khusus 
   WHERE kelas_id = ? AND hari = ? AND status = 'aktif'
     AND (
       (jam_mulai <= ? AND jam_selesai > ?) OR 
       (jam_mulai < ? AND jam_selesai >= ?) OR
       (jam_mulai >= ? AND jam_selesai <= ?)
     )`,
  [kelasId, hari, jamMulai, jamMulai, jamSelesai, jamSelesai, jamMulai, jamSelesai]
);

// 4. Get upacara schedule (kelas_id = NULL)
const [upacara] = await db.execute(
  `SELECT * FROM jadwal_khusus 
   WHERE jenis_kegiatan = 'upacara' 
     AND kelas_id IS NULL 
     AND status = 'aktif'`
);

// 5. Get perwalian for specific class
const [perwalian] = await db.execute(
  `SELECT jk.*, g.nama as nama_wali
   FROM jadwal_khusus jk
   JOIN guru g ON jk.guru_id = g.id_guru
   WHERE jk.jenis_kegiatan = 'perwalian' 
     AND jk.kelas_id = ? 
     AND jk.status = 'aktif'`,
  [kelasId]
);
```

### ❌ WRONG Patterns

```javascript
// JANGAN: Assume kelas_id always NOT NULL
SELECT * FROM jadwal_khusus WHERE kelas_id = ?; // Will miss upacara!

// JANGAN: Allow upacara with kelas_id
INSERT INTO jadwal_khusus (kelas_id, jenis_kegiatan, ...) 
VALUES (1, 'upacara', ...); // ERROR: Upacara must be NULL

// JANGAN: Allow perwalian without guru_id
INSERT INTO jadwal_khusus (guru_id, jenis_kegiatan, ...) 
VALUES (NULL, 'perwalian', ...); // ERROR: Perwalian needs guru

// JANGAN: Hard delete
DELETE FROM jadwal_khusus WHERE id = ?; // Use soft delete instead
```

